    "text": "A candle flame <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> high is kept between a wall and a concave mirror of focal length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> such that its image <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>cm</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo></math>high is formed on the wall. Find the distance of candle from the wall and also the distance between the wall and the mirror.",
